{"version":3,"term":{"cols":80,"rows":24},"timestamp":1779821623,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"/tmp/aif-demo-inner.RlHxuQ.sh","title":"AIFactory enterprise demo — Claude plans, AIFactory builds","env":{"SHELL":"/run/current-system/sw/bin/zsh"}}
[0.010, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36mAIFactory enterprise demo — single developer + Claude → multi-issue epic shipped\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.003, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36mStep 1 — Ask Claude to draft a 3-issue epic for this repo\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  We're going to ask Claude Code to do something that, in a\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  traditional workflow, would take a senior engineer a couple\r\n  of hours: design an epic, break it into actionable issues,\r\n  and open them on the repo.\r\n\r\n"]
[3.004, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36mRunning: claude -p <prompt>\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[31.028, "o", "## 🔍 REFLECT\r\n\r\n**Result:** Success — issue #6 created. All three issues created without errors. Plan complete.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## ✅ COMPLETE\r\n\r\n**Achieved:** Created all three issues in `olafkfreund/aifactory-demo`, one `gh issue create` per issue.\r\n\r\n**Issue numbers:**\r\n- **#4** — Add /healthz endpoint\r\n- **#5** — Add /version endpoint\r\n- **#6** — Document the Quick Start in README\r\n\r\n**Verified by:** Each `gh issue create` returned a live issue URL.\r\n\r\n**Files changed:** None (remote issues only).\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1000l"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[>4m\u001b[<u"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?1004l\u001b[?2031l\u001b[?2004l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b7\u001b[r\u001b8"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b]0;\u0007"]
[0.301, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[0.023, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Claude finished drafting the epic\r\n"]
[2.003, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36mStep 2 — AIFactory's Auto-Fix poll picks up the new issues\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  The 'Auto-Fix New' toggle is enabled on this project.  Normally\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  the portal polls every 5 minutes.  For this recording, we'll\r\n  trigger a poll manually:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.852, "o", "  Response:\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "    {\r\n      \"checked\": 3,\r\n      \"started\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"number\": 6,\r\n          \"title\": \"Document the Quick Start in README\",\r\n          \"body\": \"Add a Quick Start section showing the three commands a new user runs to bring the app up locally (pip install -e ., uvicorn, curl localhost:8000/).\",\r\n          \"state\": \"OPEN\",\r\n          \"labels\": [],\r\n          \"url\": \"https://github.com/olafkfreund/aifactory-demo/issues/6\",\r\n          \"provider\": \"github\",\r\n          \"specId\": \"001-gh6-document-the-quick-start-in-readme\",\r\n          \"taskId\": \"ac62db91-a89e-4238-85cb-3befdd2a7139:001-gh6-document-the-quick-start-in-readme\",\r\n          \"status\": \"started\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"number\": 5,\r\n          \"title\": \"Add /version endpoint\",\r\n          \"body\": \"Return {\\\"version\\\": __version__} from a new FastAPI route at /version.  Read the version from src/app/__init__.py.  Add a pytest case asserting the shape.\",\r\n          \"state\": \"OPEN\",\r\n          \"labels\": [],\r\n          \"url\": \"https://github.com/olafkfreund/aifactory-demo/issues/5\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "          \"provider\": \"github\",\r\n          \"specId\": \"002-gh5-add-version-endpoint\",\r\n          \"taskId\": \"ac62db91-a89e-4238-85cb-3befdd2a7139:002-gh5-add-version-endpoint\",\r\n          \"status\": \"started\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"number\": 4,\r\n          \"title\": \"Add /healthz endpoint\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "          \"body\": \"Return {\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\"} with HTTP 200 from a new FastAPI route at /healthz so a load balancer can probe liveness.  Add a pytest case covering the happy path.\",\r\n          \"state\": \"OPEN\",\r\n          \"labels\": [],\r\n          \"url\": \"https://github.com/olafkfreund/aifactory-demo/issues/4\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "          \"provider\": \"github\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "          \"specId\": \"003-gh4-add-healthz-endpoint\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "          \"taskId\": \"ac62db91-a89e-4238-85cb-3befdd2a7139:003-gh4-add-healthz-endpoint\",\r\n          \"status\": \"started\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"errors\": []\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    }\r\n"]
