[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Polled provider — checked 3 issues, started 3 agent run(s)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36mStep 3 — Watch the agents run in their isolated worktrees\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Each new issue becomes a spec under .aifactory/specs/ and an\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  agent kicks off in an isolated git worktree.  Open the portal\r\n  at http://localhost:3100/ and switch to the Live Agent Console\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  tab on any in-progress task to see real-time output.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  We'll wait here for the agents to finish.  Real wall-clock\r\n  time depends on the configured model — typically 5-15 min per\r\n  task with Claude Sonnet.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
